:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Chun-Li (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Chun-Li''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Chun-Li
|image = E 481.png
|first appearance = [[Blue Jade (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
She sports high health but low attack power which is compensated by her lightning fast attack rate and a very annoying ability: 100% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] all Cat Units. She has decent range too, making low range attackers very ineffective.

==Strategy==
To properly deal with Chun-Li you will need units with over 360 range such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or very fast units like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]].

